# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Starsea Helm · .gitattributes
#  作用：① 统一换行符 ② 告诉 Git 哪些是二进制（别做文本 diff / 换行转换）
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# 所有文件统一 LF 换行。
# Windows 上 Git 默认 core.autocrlf=true，会把 LF 转成 CRLF，
# 导致文件被反复标记成「已修改」。有了这一行就不用去改全局 git config。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资产 —— 不做换行转换、不做行级 diff
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.tga   binary
*.webp  binary
*.exr   binary
*.hdr   binary
*.dds   binary
*.ogg   binary
*.wav   binary
*.mp3   binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.glb   binary
*.gltf  binary
*.fbx   binary
*.obj   binary
*.blend binary
*.res   binary
*.scn   binary
